## Why This Is Asked
This question tests the ability to design identity guardrails across multi-tenant environments, integrating PIM, token hygiene, UEBA detection, and automated rollback capabilities. It reflects real-world risks associated with cross-tenant service principals in enterprise Azure deployments.

## Key Concepts
- Just-In-Time access via Azure AD Privileged Identity Management
- MFA enforcement on service principals
- Token hygiene and refresh token controls
- UEBA-driven threat detection and automated containment
- Defender for Cloud and Log Analytics integration
- Rollout planning and rollback criteria

## Code Example
```javascript
// Guardrail configuration pseudocode
const guardrail = {
  pim: {
    mode: 'JIT',
    autoRevoke: true,
    maxActivationMinutes: 240
  },
  mfa: {
    requiredForServicePrincipals: true,
    blockNonMfaRefreshTokens: true
  },
  ueba: {
    enabled: true,
    autoQuarantine: true,
    anomalyThreshold: 0.85
  },
  rollback: {
    targetState: 'last-known-good',
    autoRestore: true
  },
  monitoring: {
    defenderForCloud: true,
    logAnalytics: true
  }
};

// Rollout steps
async function rollout() {
  await configurePim(guardrail.pim);
  await enforceMfaPolicy(guardrail.mfa);
  await enableUeba(guardrail.ueba);
  await setupMonitoring(guardrail.monitoring);
  await testRollback();
}

// Rollback criteria
const rollbackCriteria = {
  jitterrorRate: 0.05,
  mfaFailureRate: 0.10,
 uebaFalsePositives: 0.20
};
```

## Why This Is Asked

Probes automated containment and rollback for cross-region, multi-tenant Azure SaaS. Emphasizes real-time orchestration across Key Vault, AAD, RBAC, canaries, and traffic routing.

## Key Concepts

- Defender for Cloud UEBA integrations
- Event Grid and Logic Apps for automation
- Per-tenant Key Vault key rotation and token revocation
- Tenant isolation via RBAC and traffic redirection
- Canary controls and sandbox forensics

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo handler for UEBA alert
async function handleUEBAAlert(event) {
  const id = event.tenantId;
  await rotateTenantKeys(id);
  await revokeTenantTokens(id);
  await setTenantRBAC(id, 'read-only');
  await pauseCanariesForTenant(id);
  await redirectTraffic(id, 'lastKnownGood');
  await cloneTenantSandbox(id);
}
```

