## Key Concepts
- Anomaly detection using Defender for Cloud analytics and Sentinel ML models
- Event Grid-based alert routing and per-tenant processing
- Automated resource isolation via NSG rules, private endpoint restrictions, and conditional access policies
- Key Vault credential rotation and token revocation workflows
- Deployment slot rollback with feature flag coordination
- Comprehensive audit trails across all security actions

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-logic for automated breach response
async function handleSecurityAlert(alert) {
  if (alert.severity > 3) {
    await isolateTenantResources(alert.tenantId);
    await rotateCompromisedCredentials(alert.tenantId);
    await initiateSafeRollback(alert.tenantId);
  }
}
```

